  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>「HardRock Tools &amp; Materials」</strong> 附加模組與<strong>「Create」</strong>模組為本模組完整運作之<strong>必要條件</strong><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardrock-tools-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardrock-tools-materials</a></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/874/head.png\" width=\"597\" height=\"326\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>============================================================================</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">大多數配方已修改，並採用物品手冊應用原則運作。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">這並不意味著配方變得更容易，只是生產方式不同。<br>這是一種更為直觀且手動的方式，用於製作 Create 模組的所有物品。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">可與 Create 模組本身協同運作，且不會與其他模組產生衝突。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>透過繞過工作台來取代現有的 Create 配方<br>並透過逐步添加個別組件來生產物品，直到最終物品完成。</strong><br><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">============================================================================</span><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\">全新合成方式</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/579/pokaz2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"795\" height=\"383\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/586/pokaz1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"833\" height=\"454\">================================================================================<br><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:24px\">全新物品與組件</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/774/multi3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"878\" height=\"479\"></span>==============================================================================<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/582/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"641\" height=\"393\"><br></strong></span></h2>",
